      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4ae7706798d609c3c4134fc203ede127e3eacefe49d3d7c73128fb0df14c7c3",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "2378c04fdfed50304db5bb26d5b22f1924efccd63082dab7f800b1dd1b7e1fbb",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1efa1d3cbeac4bfe0aef6819e2cb50b5fc3e1ddfdc3176220ff2cea8f1b3c98",
      "text": "Model provider",
      "hash": "ea70384c465d5c89fb7cdd19647c540c4025a1c17532dcb8b987d7b753cf8596"
    },
    {
      "id": "d80be9c2698c7e3003bf7d1981f2526edaff0a849b997bbd186a5d671072667c",
      "text": "Whatever serves a model for inference. Usually remote (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google), but can also be local (Ollama, llama.cpp).",
      "hash": "6044e996e1d061ab93937f8014c7cebd445c04a43e7264f565c0ce8956a3269b"
    },
    {
      "id": "420c4b9fd31a90b8bed8e434cf4ce32ffad3bd13a6966fb1afb67f6e7288957c",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a3cb890328790ea66cc5b2fe0e2d17d1bdaea514592e45938eef0c3c1ec72e5",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf26cda9fe6d31609ea4b465bc1a5663ab4c4afc5a9a85e711fa7557dc6a94b1",
      "text": "Whatever serves a",
      "hash": "eb068e329960eeebb23cd8af6ca390161b72a925fcf3aea6c2cf9ee72a819c7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5285008f53b8277107889cf37f9e96370c6fcc076a3559e71566e2a51506f2fb",
      "text": ". Usually a remote service (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google), but can also be local — Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp running on your own machine. The",
      "hash": "d77af177e074460a1eb260ca1c08877c45eecd9a557b64562d75aa144b02c9bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "5af4d10aa508fd7fa05b60e4335b2a454b567b95d85b4675283b1d3db2a09b76",
      "text": "doesn't run the model itself; it asks a provider to.",
      "hash": "1a03ba0d00b45473d683902733b387c841a1743d2f5f32fb0f79fdfa8f2ff079"
    },
    {
      "id": "94ed77962bd0d83a029c5438b22c0fdb12f8cbddab965ac00e4563706c08db8e",
      "text": "The provider owns the machinery: the",
      "hash": "779684edecdb9a5036f8d65efb4de79a575a25d1c370d595e1e59b20a3c3b973"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca9fe585940684fadff83ee1ba6a6cfd57ac0522358c84dcddd0a8ad5f3cb67b",
      "text": "live on its hardware, and every",
      "hash": "7a5919bc34f72e96af039cd559a4cd46077e7a273157d2f4030db64f650e612e"
    },
    {
      "id": "10d27813d338bcfbb85f8dfb0e1ddbdde06749f6d525798339910cc244dc7cee",
      "text": "model provider request",
      "hash": "3004d539f1f0ae7a40070d95ba4a1323d874684827edf4d55b29a1056f8da7a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "815837b489b1a2259ac95275c79b808a32ecf0ec2a9d6a5eef733c57f2c170ea",
      "text": "is the harness sending",
      "hash": "d2f07892e804e81fc172e9e38486a5deaabe8d609d8bc7027a21c910d130a668"
    },
    {
      "id": "613bdddbaf059345f915567721fbc5798a8d951b653bc003e4ad3f67567e45c3",
      "text": "over the network and getting predictions back. That makes the provider the source of a whole category of problems that get misattributed to the model or the harness — rate limits, degraded capacity, and outages all live here. When the",
      "hash": "eda0250a911d2e30629c2cd8999f7bb6b41334ea2ab6f9db42c9c27174ad4c57"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba592e0facb12420ef45c94ca36f3fb662c1563493506b956164f92c675e7ce5",
      "text": "stalls mid-",
      "hash": "58a6a23522bb60e507e331fc51fb7fca7b3d0934f8dcefdf1b56ba1ec3f46ffc"
    },
    {
      "id": "e82af1bb6bfa125a982a99877fd43bf54e58f6a8908fc996b8a133346d2935cb",
      "text": "or errors on every",
      "hash": "06bbdf7155e41df2ec792cac575074f8be14c6d82597ea4deab4ad756c0892c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "85acc4b40aed03fcf86ba3d7725b641e315eb3ba742c4a5521317f859859d5d3",
      "text": ", the provider's status page is worth checking before anything else.",
      "hash": "86e275d649c8bb13e9f6b926ac5761c21775779c4949069055fda015aa91d25b"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bd902d2f5900192980220591748b5d4b8cfef9e01ace57ea36bf6b52c084ca5",
      "text": "The provider also sets the commercial terms: per-token pricing for",
      "hash": "50cb49a44ae62d8483bd6a79c748020f5583e0572e8ae307f4e5e5ed76975f5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e47d94b6da3f6597180a3ff71960fd7a194810a933e6d6c584849ca01b863b7",
      "text": "output tokens",
      "hash": "b6798bcee84a53a994de8822f2954fb739ce9a8eb119121f36b363fe86182357"
    },
    {
      "id": "e0399d938cf1d4367189c67ffc5b462c8276cbbcb061398904b7dc1994fe919b",
      "text": "prefix cache",
      "hash": "2cdfb6c2d97e750050af7ef5f0ed3c788737a1776e6c1f740f856462592ba13a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9df82906c2b161c79fc5c857dae7fff3a629c0566aedafbbe3ddd652d93254d",
      "text": "discounts, and which models are available at all. Note that the provider and the model's maker can be different companies — Bedrock, Vertex, and OpenRouter serve other people's models.",
      "hash": "93f22ca2dee0319ae9881c4ff732fe32070dfae14f15e91503692c752a48fab8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a18b4c3387dcbbeae74b2fb039d441710d9ce4dfa5829e15862baa9ce001097e",
      "text": "Local providers trade capability for control: the models that fit on your own hardware are far smaller than the frontier ones, but nothing leaves the machine and there's no bill per token.",
      "hash": "f623198cf30c73a57e8800dd28a7fb55ce5a53c921ce761b41dc8828cdecd6b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "349900ba741e7368d9a92a9cad83b3d5f18d1f97975284bfc8588c7e009fcc84",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2ed2ac6620cf44d6a42c5a8dc92319cede336b9c58f9fb3cede525ee895c018",
      "text": "\"Can we run this offline for the air-gapped client?\"",
      "hash": "255d509e41c98a577b262c31abe75005d5804abc9a2877b467af99373ac3cdc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "613a3baca297950ca046aed10329212e65f10ff7246bef13a46cf37e3d5757c5",
      "text": "\"Swap the model provider to a local one — Ollama or llama.cpp on their box. The harness doesn't care, it just hits a different endpoint.\"",
      "hash": "95b9d3d2de1884f34919ebffc8c0092c7355f2ebf1b404cb9204c2ec03ef4130"
    },
    {
      "id": "63893eda70263973af8364e7aed9ac27cbb8cf8e28d2bd048944c26c861410f0",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e5e15682b3201f287298d6bda9a31854ae5d1053b1c71565c2894e63379700d",
      "text": "Non-determinism",
      "hash": "29528d719817ee2e8c9f3bb920e7820ebe1ff4bc1afc1e91f25ef655e25d4b01"
    },
    {
      "id": "43d99f214c34d9b220186d689e1c21983748470904a1e518135bae0c2e1e92dc",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "57e3e71e0d6e8e90597467a34f31fd5f22e980be8a613b5af2d82c55ea8477a5",
      "text": "Harness",
      "hash": "e3b5b45953d79a150092df37922ee6261a81040f5fb3c084fa00efffe8b98589"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc3d1b753859b6b64a766f2ac85c3fc4634834d1bd6401645814ed731930ebf1",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "afe37f5b1e44f0b456a7a31832b220e337cc1b191bb72c9ca01fc09c06004502",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc26986034903f272404893c1ab8e24642a3bb333bedca1bb51619bf162064cd",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
